Subject: [PATCH 1/5] fix(agent): recognize google streamGenerateContent in
 native fetch intercept

Add shared googlePathKind() classifier in util.ts so server.ts,
server/handle.ts, server/relay.ts and agent/native-intercept.ts keep one
definition. native-intercept.isModelApiUrl returns true for google
generate/count-tokens paths, routing antigravity/gemini streamGenerateContent
through the bili proxy (was wire-mode direct, leaving ~492k raw cacheRead
per turn).
